OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGGORBACHEV REJECTS CALL TO
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGCHANGE PARTY NAME
OL,4,D
OL,5, Soviet President Mikhail Gorbachev has
OL,6, rejected a call to change the name of
OL,7, the Soviet Communist Party, says TASS.
OL,9,FThe President told the party central
OL,10,Fcommittee that the move would seriously
OL,11,Fharm the communists' "ideological
OL,12,Ffoundation" and frustrate many members.
OL,14,FMr Gorbachev also proposed revamping
OL,15,Fthe Politburo into a Presidium to
OL,16,Finclude leaders of the republican
OL,17,Fcommunist parties.
OL,19,FTASS said he also proposed calling a
OL,20,Fspecial party congress on 2 July to
OL,21,Fcarry out these and other changes.
OL,23,D]FFromG11-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
