OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGPERES VOWS TO
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGBREAK UP COALITION
OL,4,D
OL,5, Israel's vice-premier has vowed to end
OL,6, the coalition with Prime Minister
OL,7, Yitzhak Shamir unless agreement is
OL,8, reached on the US peace proposals.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FShimon Peres led a walk-out of Labour
OL,11,Fmembers after Mr Shamir refused a vote.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FMr Peres said he viewed the lack of a
OL,14,Fdecision as rejection of the proposals.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FHe said he will seek a free hand from
OL,17,Fhis Labour party to call a vote of no
OL,18,Fconfidence in the government.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FThe crucial issue is whether to let
OL,21,Feast Jerusalem Arabs vote in elections.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG11-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
